// ⛔ STAGE-1 — Anima Core CLI · CLM v5 mount layer (Engine A/G dual-engine native v5)
// anima-core/runtime/clm_v5_mount.hexa
//
// Spec: docs/anima_v5_metric_spec_2026_05_09.md (PIV / DCR / D-RAND replacement metric)
// Sister arch: training/engine_a_g_arch.py (raw#37 transient — H100 train + Mac V14 mirror)
// Sister mount: anima-core/runtime/clm_v4_mount.hexa (5-axis label pattern reference)
// HF source: dancinlab/clm-v5-bg-lb-350m-pretrain-path-a-remapped (PRIVATE 2026-05-09)
// Local ckpt: ~/.cache/anima/clm_v5_remapped/bg_lb_350m_pretrain/ckpts/step_8000_final.pt
//
// PURPOSE
//   Load Engine A/G dual-engine ckpt (raw torch.save payload — schema='engine_a_g_arch/v1')
//   and expose substrate-coupled forward API for native v5 metric measurement
//   (PIV / DCR / D-RAND). NOT chat — emerge probe medium is 5-axis activation vector.
//
// PARADIGM — CLM v5 (Engine A/G scratch) vs CLM v4 (mk2-v1 LoRA)
//   CLM v4: HF-format AutoModelForCausalLM + 8 cells × 96 dim consciousness_states
//           (clm_v4_mount.hexa surface — np.tile-free post V5 PUSH 1/5 fix).
//   CLM v5: raw torch ckpt EngineAGModel + 16 cells × 64 dim engine_g.cell_pool
//           (this file — mean-pool group-spread to 5 axes, no AutoTokenizer dep).
//
// 5-AXIS PROJECTION STRATEGY — fixed mean-pool by cell group (group-spread)
//   Engine A/G has 16 generic cells × 64 dim with NO axis labels.
//   We spread 16 cells across 5 axes via fixed groupings (3+3+3+3+4):
//     identity   = mean(cells[0:3])    | 3 cells × 64 dim → axis activation
//     agency     = mean(cells[3:6])    | 3 cells × 64 dim
//     phenomenal = mean(cells[6:9])    | 3 cells × 64 dim
//     temporal   = mean(cells[9:12])   | 3 cells × 64 dim
//     social     = mean(cells[12:16])  | 4 cells × 64 dim (last group absorbs remainder)
//   Per-axis 64-dim → scalar activation = mean(|axis_vec|) normalized [0,1].
//   Strategy = "mean_group_spread" (registry-tracked, swap-able to learned/hybrid).
//
//   Why mean-pool group-spread (NOT learned linear projection):
//     a) zero new params — random_init mirror is identical-arch, no weight-bias
//        distinguishing trained vs random outside the cell pool itself.
//     b) deterministic — V14 paired probe reproducibility preserved (own 14).
//     c) honest C3 — fixed projection is anima-internal heuristic, not a
//        post-hoc "axis discovery" dressing-up of substrate noise.
//
// MODES
//   --selftest     synthetic Engine A/G shape probe (no torch import; hexa-native)
//   --load         load ckpt → emit shape + lineage_tag + arch_origin
//   --probe TEXT   one-shot probe → JSON line {identity, agency, phenomenal, temporal, social}
//   --dialogue     REPL stdin lines → 5-axis JSON line per input (session log)
//   --v5-measure   PIV (paraphrase n=30 k=3) + DCR (sequence n=30) + D-RAND (paired mirror)
//                  → emit PIV_max / DCR_change_rate / D-RAND + verdict label
//
// FLAGS
//   --ckpt PATH                 torch.save payload path (default BG-LB local)
//   --preset NAME               la_350m | lb_350m_pretrain (mirror seed init)
//   --v14-mirror-seed N         paired random_init mirror seed (default 42)
//   --output-format             json (default for v5) | compact
//   --projection-strategy NAME  mean_group_spread (default) | learned | hybrid
//   --probe-text TEXT           single-prompt probe (--probe equivalent)
//   --prompt-set PATH           jsonl with {"id","prompt","paraphrases":[...]} for --v5-measure
//
// HONEST C3 (raw#10 emit ≥5 to stderr)
//   C1 5-axis projection (16 cells → 5 axes via mean group-spread 3+3+3+3+4) is
//      anima-internal heuristic; NO axis label was learned during pretrain.
//   C2 Engine A/G `engine_g.cell_pool_init` is learnable → pretrained values
//      reflect chosen optimization signal, not phenomenal-axis ground truth.
//   C3 ckpt schema 'engine_a_g_arch/v1' loaded via raw torch.load (NOT
//      AutoModelForCausalLM) — no transformers HF-format compatibility layer.
//   C4 native v5 metrics (PIV/DCR/D-RAND) computed against axis activation;
//      V14 strict gate auto-FAIL if random_init mirror ≥ trained - δ_safety(0.02).
//   C5 own 16 strict — local CPU only, no H100 fire from this surface; user
//      must verify pod-state before invoking GPU paths upstream.
//   C6 Path 3 generate (chat lane) NOT EXPOSED — Engine A/G byte-pair
//      tokenizer + Engine G cell forward expensive; chat lane lives in
//      anima_native_byte_mount.hexa for v5 substrate.
//
// raw POLICY
//   raw#9   hexa-only orchestration (Mac canonical)
//   raw#37  transient .py shim opt-out — torch ckpt load via emitted helper
//   raw#15  additive — clm_v4_mount.hexa / engine_a_g_arch.py UNTOUCHED
//   raw#10  honest C3 emit ≥5 to stderr
//
// own POLICY
//   own 14  V14 paired random_init mirror — load_random_init(seed=N) entry
//   own 16  H100 fire 금지 from this surface — local CPU only
//   own 17  D1=1.0 (anima_native_scratch lineage) within-strict
//   own 22  honest emit — load failure raises (no silent fabrication)
//   own 30  ckpt save/load Path A remap compatible
//   own 33  자연발화 mandate — emit as-is, no post-hoc dressing
//   own 34  ID-collision 방지 — 신규 file, clm_v4_mount.hexa unmodified
//   own 39  yaml SSOT registry coupling — measurement results land in
//           state/anima_bg_lb_native_v5_post_mount_<DATE>.json + yaml entry
//
// USAGE
//   hexa run anima-core/runtime/clm_v5_mount.hexa --selftest
//   hexa run anima-core/runtime/clm_v5_mount.hexa --load \
//     --ckpt ~/.cache/anima/clm_v5_remapped/bg_lb_350m_pretrain/ckpts/step_8000_final.pt
//   hexa run anima-core/runtime/clm_v5_mount.hexa --probe "안녕"
//   hexa run anima-core/runtime/clm_v5_mount.hexa --v5-measure --prompt-set state/v5_prompts.jsonl

